        {
            "title": "Magic Paper has been officially released.",
            "date": "2024-07-18 06:26:56",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5969041959964371418",
            "content": "Hello, game fans!\n\nThe long-awaited game Magic Paper has finally been released on Steam!\n\nTo celebrate, we have prepared a special event just for you.\n\nLaunch Discount: Enjoy Magic Paper at a 40% discount for the first two weeks!\n\nWe look forward to your interest and participation, and we invite you to the magical world of paper!\n\nSincerely,\nThe Magic Paper Team"
        },
        {
            "title": "Ver 1.0",
            "date": "2024-07-18 06:04:26",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5969041959964314539",
            "content": "Official release!"
        },
        {
            "title": "Magic Paper Official Launch Announcement!",
            "date": "2024-07-12 05:40:18",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6000566704268807573",
            "content": "Hello from TeleportSoft!\n\nWe’re thrilled to announce that the official launch of Magic Paper is just around the corner! 🎉\n\nOn July 18, 2024, we will be officially releasing the game with a special 40% discount to celebrate this exciting moment. We’ve put a lot of time and effort into this release, and we’re so happy to finally share it with you.\n\nA big thank you to everyone who supported us during Early Access! Your feedback was crucial in helping us make the game better, and we hope you enjoy the official release.\n\nThank you!"
        },
